WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.083
Step 1: Select the Head Office location and open Home. Manager profiles with Home, Reporting and all-location access see the Head Office dashboard there. Selecting a store shows its Store dashboard; Staff profiles keep an operational dashboard without sales.

2
00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:23.333
Step 2: On Head Office, choose accessible locations in this company and a week. Compare recorded sales, saved cost percentages, orders and location performance. Open Reporting for the same selection.

3
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:33.917
Step 3: On a store dashboard, use Today and This hour for projected sales and labour budget, compare saved hourly sales, and review ordering, checklists, published staff shifts and quick links.

4
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:45.125
Step 4: Use Edit Home on a computer to customise the company layout. Head Office, Store and Staff layouts are independent; existing custom sections and the company’s colours, fonts and logos are retained.
